# Force LF for anything with a shebang or a shell-adjacent syntax that
# breaks on CRLF (a CRLF shebang line, e.g. "#!/bin/bash\r", fails to exec
# on Linux/macOS). Blobs in this repo are already LF-only (git-checked, see
# docs/AUDIT-v3.md Fase 0) — this just stops a future commit from a Windows
# machine with core.autocrlf=true from introducing CRLF, which would also
# make `shellcheck` fail with spurious SC1017 "Literal carriage return".
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bats text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
